Sorry, this is at least misleading. Beginners should know that you CAN drink
from fountains, you can get something nice, but also something nasty. So better
wait until you:
1) increase your luck, as nicer things can happen to you
2) can handle all nasty things that can come out...

>  Potions are usually safe to drink,
>although many have harmful side effects (but they probably won't kill
>you). 

Drink potions if you are in safety. Even better - wait with drinking,
see what the monsters do with their potions - it is a good way of identifying
them. Mosters ill generally drink 'good' potions they have, and hurl bad ones 
at you - effects of hurling are not that bas as the effects of drinking...

>Finally, if you're having problems figuring out the game, try playing in
